# mdeai task numbering

When creating, renaming, or reordering anything under `tasks/**`, follow **one global build order** and **one canonical file per task**.

## Tier order (always)

Execute and list tasks in this sequence within each domain:

```text
core → mvp → post-mvp → advanced
```

| Tier | When | Typical scope |
|------|------|----------------|
| **core** | Revenue, auth, platform gates, P0 infra | Must ship before vertical MVP |
| **mvp** | Phase 1 persona-visible hero flows | Done gate = localhost + tests |
| **post-mvp** | Polish, vitest depth, optional workflows | After MVP index is complete |
| **advanced** | Phase 2+, automation, partner CRM, suspend/resume | Explicitly out of Phase 1 |

**Never** interleave tiers in an index table. **Never** create a second file that tracks the same work (no lifecycle “mirror” specs).

---

## Required index per domain

Every task folder that has ordered specs **must** have a tier index authors update in the same PR as renames:

| Folder | Index file |
|--------|------------|
| `tasks/core/` | Listed in [`tasks/INDEX.md`](../tasks/INDEX.md) F01–Fxx table |
| `tasks/venues/tasks/` | [`mvp/mvp-index.md`](../tasks/venues/tasks/mvp/mvp-index.md) + [`post-mvp/post-mvp-index.md`](../tasks/venues/tasks/post-mvp/post-mvp-index.md) |
| `tasks/events/` | [`INDEX.md`](../tasks/events/INDEX.md) |
| `tasks/maps/` | [`INDEX.md`](../tasks/maps/INDEX.md) + [`NUMBERING.md`](../tasks/maps/NUMBERING.md) |
| `tasks/openclaw/tasks/` | [`index-ocl.md`](../tasks/openclaw/index-ocl.md) |

New domain folder → add `{tier}-index.md` or single `INDEX.md` with tier sections **core · mvp · post-mvp · advanced** in order.

---

## Filename patterns (by domain)

Use **zero-padded step numbers** in **implementation order**. Put **tier** and **layer** in the name when the domain uses them.

| Domain | Pattern | Example | Notes |
|--------|---------|---------|-------|
| Platform | `F{NN}-*.md` | `F09-floor-script-and-vitest.md` | `tasks/core/` — F01–F13, F18–F20, F48–F50 |
| Venues data | `data-{NNN}-*.md` | `data-004-restaurant-seed.md` | `tasks/venues/tasks/mvp/data/` steps **01–08** |
| Venues build | `{NNN}-ven-{layer}-*.md` | `015-ven-mastra-request-booking-tool.md` | MVP **09–24**; post-MVP **25–34** |
| Venues wireframes | `{NNN}-{scr\|wire}-*.md` | `008-scr-restaurant-listings-map.md` | Design refs in `mvp/wireframes/` — not build step numbers |
| Events | `EVP-{NNN}-{tier}-*.md` | `EVP-002-core-ticket-checkout-webhook-port.md` | Tier in filename: `core` · `mvp` · `advanced` |
| Maps | `MAP-{NNN}-*.md` | `MAP-004-places-grounding-clients.md` | Order in [`maps/INDEX.md`](../tasks/maps/INDEX.md) |
| OpenClaw | `OCL-{NNN}-{tier}-*.md` | `OCL-013-mvp-coffee-tour-crawler.md` | Ranges in [`openclaw/tasks/INDEX.md`](../tasks/openclaw/tasks/INDEX.md) |
| Screens | `{NNN}-scr-*` / `{NNN}-wire-*` | Paired scr+wire per [`SCR-WIRE-PAIRING-CHECKLIST.md`](../tasks/screens/SCR-WIRE-PAIRING-CHECKLIST.md) |

**Layer tokens** (venues build + post-mvp): `mastra` · `copilot` · `vitest` · `data` · `supabase` · `maps` (when Maps-specific)

