## Venues spine (reference)

```text
mvp/data/     01–08   data-001 … data-008
mvp/          09–24   009-ven-* … 024-ven-*
post-mvp/     25–34   025-ven-* … 034-ven-*
advanced/     35+     035-ven-* … (when folder exists)
