## Frontmatter (required on every spec)

```yaml
task_id: ven-015          # or F09, EVP-002-core, MAP-004, OCL-013-mvp
mvp_step: 015             # or post_mvp_step: 025 — match filename step
layer: mastra             # mastra | copilot | vitest | data | supabase | UI | …
depends_on: [ven-014]     # use canonical ids only — not CKV-*, MSV-*, CAF-*
unblocks: [ven-016]
status: Not Started
```

- **`depends_on` / `unblocks`** must reference **canonical** ids (`ven-*`, `data-*`, `F*`, `EVP-*`), not retired prefixes.
- Do **not** add `legacy_id` columns to indexes or create redirect stub files.

---

## Adding or renumbering tasks

1. Read the domain **index** — confirm tier and next free step number.
2. Pick tier: default **mvp** unless clearly platform (**core**) or Phase 2+ (**advanced** / **post-mvp**).
3. Name file with step + domain prefix + layer (if venues).
4. Insert row in index in **dependency order**, not alphabetical.
5. Update `depends_on` on downstream specs in the same change.
6. **Delete** superseded duplicate trackers — do not leave “Moved →” stubs.

---

## Anti-patterns (reject in review)

| Don't | Do instead |
|-------|------------|
| CAF-010 / CKV-001 / MSV-005 parallel files | One `ven-NNN` spec |
| `legacy/` redirect stubs | Update links; delete old file |
| Second index with different order | Single `*-index.md` per tier spine |
| scr/wire as build steps 09–24 | Wireframes in `wireframes/`; build in `ven-*` |
| advanced work in mvp folder | `post-mvp/` or `advanced/` + index row |

---

## Verification

After numbering changes:

```bash
node scripts/verify-scr-wire-pairing.mjs   # if scr/wire touched
```

Before marking Done: `task-verifier` + index row status matches disk.
